// hrms — the data model of frappe/hrms, expressed in .lite.
//
// Derived mechanically from hrms/**/doctype/*/*.json (GPL-3.0) by
// `litestone import --from frappe`. A CORPUS FIXTURE, not a design:
// nothing here is a claim about how any of it should be modelled, and every
// place the conversion made a choice the source did not is recorded in
// gaps.json. 160 models. Regenerate with fetch.mjs.

